#. Description of the plugin
#: kaupang-review-images.php
msgid "Review image and avatar uploads for WooCommerce product reviews — customers attach a product photo and a profile picture to their review, stored as ordinary media attachments; conditional Gravatar loading keeps default avatars off the page. Part of the Kaupang suite."
msgstr ""

